(4, 'Senior Android Engineer', 'Speechify', 'We are seeking a Senior Android Engineer to support the growth of our Android app, the most used text-to-speech app in the Play Store. The ideal candidate thinks strategically, enjoys fast-paced environments, and has experience building great user experiences that delight users. As a key role in our flat organization, you will have the opportunity to become a leader by showing excellent technical skills and making product decisions that drive innovation.', '[\"Kotlin\",\"Android\",\"UX\",\"Architecture\",\"Debugging\",\"Performance\"]\n', 'Berlin, Berlin, Germany', 0, NULL, 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/speechify/tech-lead-android-core-product-berlin-germany-215490', 'tech-lead-android-core-product-berlin-germany-215490', '[-0.015852567,-0.0016316692,0.009777611,-0.07567305,-0.019181736,0.0122041805,-0.010877147,-0.009790147,0.023384616,0.0018909455,-0.001781905,0.010848246,0.00438821,0.008380141,0.096342534,0.0022980722,0.010995935,0.008096923,-0.019779127,-0.019599967,-0.010809652,-0.0016674731,0.03460229,-0.024372064,-0.013072817,-0.02648973,0.02044882,0.0009990139,0.03283596,-0.0012851227,-0.0034880575,-0.0028183542,0.008201892,0.011832955,-0.010918106,-0.0049919146,0.027774746,-0.03430623,0.018052984,0.017231032,0.014869856,0.028653253,-0.015281434,-0.034147497,-0.014402842,-0.0060689263,0.0012465228,-0.01596622,-0.018802738,0.022324007,-0.015512791,-0.007120223,0.002628174,-0.19682723,-0.008721166,-0.01434431,0.0070500774,-0.01232808,-0.011558731,-0.013953086,-0.0026452565,0.038137674,-0.009676266,0.0044765365,-0.014509973,-0.0074971314,-0.0018892429,-0.016114661,-0.017344784,-0.024220861,-0.015313791,0.008860184,-0.005115249,-0.015671263,-0.040404532,-0.014617167,-0.0033822302,0.00065695186,0.021473592,0.019802492,-0.0075132116,-0.00086569134,0.005836691,-0.015107673,0.001359595,0.013671613,0.008387712,-0.025671922,-0.0038580748,0.0091520315,-0.0113583775,-0.009375632,0.017400837,0.00808637