(7, 'Senior Full-Stack Engineer', 'Atolls', 'We are seeking a Senior Full Stack Engineer to join our Admin Experience team. As a key part of our team, you will be directly involved in building and enhancing digital destinations for our users. Your contributions will help shape how millions of consumers interact with our platforms. You will be instrumental in supporting the development of new features and products, working across the entire stack from the database layer to the client layer. We value personal and professional growth, and offer a supportive team, flexible working schedule, and opportunities for internal mobility.', '[\"JavaScript\",\"FullStack\",\"APIs\",\"Databases\",\"Frontend\",\"Backend\"]\n', 'Berlin, Berlin, Germany', 0, NULL, 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/atolls/senior-full-stack-engineer-platform-react-typescript-nodejs-berlin-58844', 'senior-full-stack-engineer-platform-react-typescript-nodejs-berlin-58844', '[-0.014231639,-0.004287184,0.016390072,-0.07005294,-0.008704393,0.023482108,0.0032537968,0.0009869492,0.03575509,0.004327795,-0.020428395,-0.008160174,0.017601997,0.00019857334,0.096361935,0.025175607,0.016534926,0.0035883447,-0.024426531,-0.0011459148,0.0024410696,0.015103882,0.027325507,-0.022994231,-0.019831076,-0.0031065315,0.0107972445,0.012195008,0.035678707,-0.01657964,-0.00836337,0.0031896203,0.010584944,0.025013668,-0.008415408,0.0051211603,0.012428321,0.0033647434,-0.0017742997,0.0065499134,0.01881969,0.015483918,-0.011869976,-0.0294361,-0.01947765,-0.0052574133,0.0073286695,0.005551428,-0.0064057335,0.009385142,-0.01392915,-0.008213113,-0.030414695,-0.18373074,-0.03205089,0.005483058,-0.004552289,-0.0068381154,-0.006989363,-0.013474099,-0.017084127,0.02311702,-0.013866313,-0.0031401836,-0.03049864,0.009766277,-0.0011259689,-0.023258599,-0.012229444,-0.023046885,-0.007962156,0.001522574,-0.0029235075,-0.022492802,-0.026675731,-0.0074635576,-0.0066474546,-0.015268722,0.015849914,0.0062613236,0.003133132,-