(9, 'Senior RF Solutions Engineer', 'Spire', 'As a senior engineer, you will lead technical engagements for RF geolocation solutions, providing space-based signals intelligence and emitter geolocation services to government customers. This role combines solution engineering, product strategy, and mission delivery. Key responsibilities include leading pre-sales engagements, designing mission-focused RF geolocation solutions, and providing technical account management support. You will represent the RF product in the EU region and contribute to the global roadmap.', '[\"RFEngineering\",\"Geolocation\",\"SignalProcessing\",\"SolutionDesign\",\"PreSales\",\"TechnicalLeadership\"]\n', 'Munich, Bavaria, Germany', 0, NULL, 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/spire/rf-intelligence-solutions-engineer-munich-493859', 'rf-intelligence-solutions-engineer-munich-493859', '[-0.015785186,0.013424435,0.02528069,-0.09214175,-0.0003380769,0.031122565,-0.008590401,-0.008184072,0.011770604,0.01821781,-0.03207779,0.019479081,0.00020034968,0.01379313,0.09277299,0.029167542,0.011185331,0.012146164,0.0009242744,-0.005267017,-0.017806072,0.0076349294,0.019155325,-0.01228309,-0.0054487446,-0.020320725,-0.011642637,-0.01133556,0.043126997,-0.001619057,-0.016557768,0.0030749526,-0.000050339673,0.045179494,-0.00061780633,-0.009602413,0.027073372,-0.019931722,0.01955439,-0.014984644,-0.001660245,0.018768482,-0.005785013,-0.029238757,-0.019018203,-0.03656619,0.014806706,0.0013748186,-0.0069668433,0.032515813,-0.023627544,0.014196653,-0.00024875245,-0.18371493,-0.014032343,0.0075148987,0.013856501,-0.0055823578,0.0021216064,-0.0053636967,-0.015423603,0.023355262,0.006079147,-0.0006722589,-0.0023754153,-0.013112882,-0.01843717,-0.024140121,-0.042092822,-0.01797013,-0.008172154,0.011672414,-0.011530978,-0.02079427,-0.021057941,0.010662538,0.006661095,-0.00892243,0.005165618,0.010030976,-0.01185481,-0.0069707623,-0.007993195,-0.0013923403,0.018628255,0.008736631,-0.024755226,-0.005