(10, 'Software Engineer - Build & Deploy', 'Wolt - English', 'We\'re a team that creates technology to bring joy, simplicity, and earnings to neighborhoods worldwide. We\'re building a platform for delivering various goods and services in over 500 cities across 30 countries. Our team specializes in designing and implementing systems for smooth software deployment and maintenance. As a software engineer, you\'ll design, develop, and maintain cutting-edge solutions, working closely with other engineers to ensure seamless system integration and growth.', '[\"SoftwareEngineering\",\"SystemDesign\",\"Deployment\",\"Maintenance\",\"Integration\",\"Collaboration\"]\n', 'Berlin, Berlin, Germany', 0, NULL, 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/wolt-english/software-engineer-build-deploy-core-group-berlin-105457', 'software-engineer-build-deploy-core-group-berlin-105457', '[-0.015704349,-0.011993776,0.005410745,-0.06373089,-0.008871726,0.014426502,0.0074760923,0.003949722,0.012959291,-0.011194061,-0.019945014,0.014948016,0.028488992,0.030042864,0.10797915,0.026779855,0.007299955,0.011596194,-0.010561166,-0.009078753,0.0053755315,0.010281869,0.026627524,-0.03684355,-0.010729573,-0.015522946,0.018625218,0.008155623,0.048543964,-0.02006502,-0.0053122547,0.010958189,0.00345068,0.030039443,-0.018816248,-0.00024117371,0.021892209,-0.020432979,-0.0030640035,-0.00009160417,0.008094729,0.020895775,4.3083256e-7,-0.02499736,-0.013193291,-0.016181765,-0.0027159445,-0.016274577,-0.0071758577,-0.008238783,-0.011752026,-0.009184905,0.0026743754,-0.1838045,-0.025965028,-0.025668373,0.007020396,-0.023219585,0.0020639156,-0.011389489,-0.02748147,0.008955684,-0.020926038,-0.020095306,-0.02682214,-0.01320666,-0.0017667741,-0.026420224,-0.01450897,-0.015066148,0.0038066737,0.0037541885,-0.012643862,-0.00885007,-0.029076269,-0.0067201112,-0.01664636,0.0030716131,0.003646394,0.019727567,-0.01562753,-0.012687424,0.0038757832,-0.016437411,0.008358089,0.004824053,-0.0050082635,-0.0095