(11, 'Founder\'s Associate', 'Heidi Systems', 'We are a Prop- & ClimateTech company building the modern infrastructure for digital measurement services. As a Founder\'s Associate, you will work directly with our founder team, taking on real responsibility from day one, driving your own initiatives, and bringing operational topics to fruition. Our goal is to make a high-complex value chain transparent, efficient, and scalable by connecting IoT hardware, software, and operational excellence. We are a founding team of serial founders with backgrounds in consulting, Big Tech, and successful scale-ups. You will work closely with us, sit at the same table, and receive a steep learning curve, fast pace, and maximum responsibility.', '[\"Business Development\"]', 'Berlin', 0, 'Internship', 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/heidi-systems/founders-associate-intern-fulltime-berlin-280202', 'founders-associate-intern-fulltime-berlin-280202', '[-0.007822678,0.00035831117,0.022401962,-0.07898846,-0.027398203,0.017871993,-0.021276034,0.0024550715,0.022906141,0.0056218775,-0.014541114,0.010889712,0.008280155,-0.009238205,0.109173805,0.030011911,0.031949464,0.017312452,-0.025799854,0.024090009,-0.014886242,0.008468539,0.015889406,-0.009719892,-0.03189503,-0.0067860195,0.011656463,0.017670661,0.02211585,0.022194821,-0.0017539854,0.0133545045,0.031770583,0.022139302,0.014931316,0.0021074254,0.00691697,0.0039198487,0.010350381,0.009227659,0.013150119,0.004410992,-0.02585389,-0.0012790597,-0.04074616,-0.015461122,0.0061311033,-0.021481223,-0.001754308,0.01610768,-0.0047320616,0.018835219,-0.007577492,-0.17412257,-0.025183333,-0.00054709095,0.025458071,-0.028514404,0.020838886,-0.0279239,-0.031865593,0.01696854,-0.012993977,-0.004365685,-0.026792113,-0.009170614,-0.009083397,-0.0327343,-0.013277257,-0.0096481955,-0.0026869085,-0.0014517686,-0.027205504,-0.005118974,-0.031921927,-0.011593869,-0.024575029,-0.013537399,0.0007125666,0.0133291045,0.012694048,0.028098773,0