(12, 'Studio Technician', 'Tim Seidl-PRODUCTIONS GmbH', 'We are seeking a motivated Studio Technician to join our team at Tim Seidl-PRODUCTIONS GmbH. The successful candidate will be responsible for ensuring the smooth operation of our studio productions. Key responsibilities include technical support for film and photo productions, setup and maintenance of lighting and camera equipment, and organization of studio equipment. The ideal candidate will have a background in film, media, or event technology and excellent knowledge of lighting, camera equipment, and studio technology.', '[\"Management\",\"Team Leader\"]', 'Schwäbisch Hall', 0, 'berufserfahren', 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/tim-seidl-productions-gmbh/studiotechniker-film-medienproduktion-schwabisch-hall-464433', 'studiotechniker-film-medienproduktion-schwabisch-hall-464433', '[-0.0150820855,-0.010541611,0.0083244005,-0.0809853,-0.007751435,0.016006403,-0.030775463,-0.011696074,-0.008071325,0.021351622,-0.021551637,0.0071991365,-0.005529533,0.0054544946,0.102280304,0.015239548,0.018959695,0.0017635586,0.00038943285,0.034447998,-0.0030032417,-0.016616022,0.034867797,-0.008257307,-0.007759596,-0.03539528,0.032250155,0.020842662,0.032797143,-0.025996368,0.01625952,0.008651144,0.026428178,0.01944302,0.027489472,-0.012889394,0.003938724,-0.0038365717,-0.002816717,0.014921149,0.0035926795,0.042912558,-0.028554317,-0.031046309,0.0043609324,-0.00079589564,0.010896102,-0.01760868,-0.0024226871,0.013458117,0.0031284287,-0.008079629,-0.004690514,-0.18785647,-0.032451656,0.009787709,0.015239602,0.010016047,0.0015313489,-0.0075429166,-0.020157406,0.049401633,0.015113523,-0.036008105,0.010331995,0.014077458,-0.023507986,-0.011464052,-0.010151136,0.011090107,-0.0024736554,-0.002762283,-0.033896774,-0.008724459,-0.012832234,-0.027839517,-0.016178206,0.009241721,0.011233113,0.025639499,-0.00077423465,-0.01866179,-0.011162096,-0.00693681,-0.00701439,0.020017587,0.012250584,0.01975016,0.00016757645,0