(15, 'Co-Founder / Tech-Partner', 'Nomoscale AI', 'Our vision is to provide a single interface for agencies and marketers to access, with AI already analyzing, prioritizing, and suggesting tasks for the day. This interface should be cross-channel, automated, and proactive. We already have a functional demo and the core technology in place. Key responsibilities include developing a solid backend and secure architecture, implementing a multi-client structure and user management, and integrating APIs beyond the first channel. We also need to handle deployment and scaling. Required skills include experience with Supabase, JavaScript/TypeScript, and REST APIs. A basic understanding of secure architecture is also necessary. We welcome a work-student or freelancer from the Nuremberg area. Benefits include a 50/50 equity split, flexible working hours, and direct influence on product decisions from day one.', '[\"IT\"]', 'Nuremberg', 0, NULL, 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/nomoscale-ai/co-founder-tech-partner-aus-nurnberg-und-umgebung-nuremberg-96964', 'co-founder-tech-partner-aus-nurnberg-und-umgebung-nuremberg-96964', '[-0.004636501,0.0008298542,0.034223374,-0.0930938,-0.0018202829,0.021999445,0.0054203817,-0.0069190697,0.018275559,-0.0151379565,-0.005107942,-0.00016130575,0.0071204025,-0.006285338,0.11203278,0.014261031,-0.0035319403,0.016830714,-9.918097e-6,0.015342354,0.009887498,-0.0125615075,0.056145635,-0.016966565,-0.008446669,-0.011905772,-0.0030616464,0.015198226,0.005739476,0.018261809,-0.007342571,0.0029885808,0.014137124,-0.004138495,0.0057837516,0.01308652,0.011224672,0.010637761,0.02492781,0.00895611,-0.0068328814,0.002761128,-0.009143856,-0.028246395,-0.015247243,-0.01284313,0.0027817544,-0.021242304,-0.008575665,0.014729252,-0.013721203,0.017302517,-0.003156834,-0.17263252,-0.044459276,0.008097449,0.0042810836,-0.01695885,0.008905421,0.0034401093,-0.022052897,0.041716438,-0.0008906038,-0.022788063,-0.0013244698,-0.02151789,0.00355589