(16, 'BMW Service Leadership Position', 'Autohaus Walter Mulfinger GmbH', 'We are a large, family-owned automotive group representing brands BMW, MINI, Renault, and Dacia in eastern Baden-Württemberg. We are seeking a BMW Service Leadership to join our team in Schwäbisch Gmünd. Key responsibilities include leading and developing our skilled service team, optimizing service processes, and ensuring quality standards. The ideal candidate will have leadership experience, knowledge of automotive technology, and a completed vocational training in automotive technology. We offer a secure, unlimited contract, competitive compensation, and various employee benefits, including a company bike and professional development opportunities.', '[\"Customer Service\"]', 'Schwäbisch Gmünd', 0, NULL, 'arbeitnow', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/autohaus-walter-mulfinger-gmbh/bmw-serviceleitung-schwabisch-gmund-459246', 'bmw-serviceleitung-schwabisch-gmund-459246', '[0.000751428,-0.005338796,0.03270436,-0.05621367,0.0012597527,0.017534906,-0.017907916,0.009103671,0.017551372,0.0044257655,-0.0067237886,0.0017586288,0.00045273438,0.016188836,0.11753514,0.020499092,0.030061137,0.0225127,-0.023084737,0.008325172,-0.012901346,-0.015030008,0.03157769,-0.0012848981,-0.023934152,-0.014563522,0.0070404457,0.031180967,0.025170673,0.00964951,-0.0023985687,0.029055413,0.010029364,0.006043408,0.007125886,-0.006071568,0.035590436,0.008181525,0.018033924,0.014392784,-0.0023244757,0.0102784475,-0.011192816,-0.010726923,0.0030935134,-0.002777956,0.010764976,-0.028549094,-0.014675101,0.0011683574,-0.00071805384,0.011898786,-0.009460319,-0.16905354,-0.031076465,0.014785283,0.005271375,0.0073279263,0.0008593574,-0.0024900096,-0.00812968,0.036491025,-0.008064877,-0.028851006,0.02869806,-0.016155664,-0.0142163895,0.0075014173,0.003054711,-0.00972591,0.014307437,-0.0035321964,-0.034374736,-0.038813543,-0.011262238,-0.02842574,-0.021251624,-0.004128461,-0.013595823,0.01934507,-0.0041715414,0.00889049