(54, 'Account Executive, Platforms (Existing Business)', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>About Stripe</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;
INSERT IGNORE INTO `Job` (`id`, `title`, `company`, `description`, `tags`, `location`, `remote`, `jobType`, `sourceApi`, `sourceUrl`, `externalId`, `embedding`, `embeddedAt`, `postedAt`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `category`) VALUES
(55, 'Account Executive, Platforms, Existing Business (French Speaking)', 'Stripe', 'Who we are\nStripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from large enterprises to ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Stripe’s mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, offering the opportunity to impact the global economy while doing meaningful work.\n\nAbout the team\nThe Startup SaaS Platform team works with European startups in a key segment for Stripe. SaaS platforms use Stripe to embed payments and financial services into their own products, making Stripe a critical partner for their growth (e.g., Shopify, Mindbody, Lightspeed).\n\nThe team focuses on identifying and developing strategic accounts in Europe, helping high-potential companies scale globally, better serve their users, and create new revenue streams through monetization of payments and financial services.\n\nWhat you’ll do\nAs an Account Executive on the Startup SaaS Platforms team, you will drive Stripe’s growth by prospecting businesses, explaining Stripe’s value, and advising companies on optimizing their business using Stripe solutions. You will help users understand how Stripe’s financial infrastructure supports growth and provides a competitive advantage.\n\nResponsibilities\n\nManage and develop new prospects while creating account plans to win and expand business with high-growth startups\n\nUnderstand user pain points and propose tailored SaaS platform solutions\n\nLead complex evaluations of Stripe’s solutions, working with cross-functional teams (Product, Risk, Operations)\n\nDrive projects through activation and adoption phases\n\nBuild relationships with executive stakeholders and represent Stripe in the startup ecosystem\n\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams to improve internal efficiency and overall business impact\n\nMinimum requirements\n\n4–6+ years of experience in a client-facing or closing sales role\n\nAbility to understand complex technical ecosystems\n\nStrong relationship-building skills with technical customers\n\nAnalytical ability to manage complex sales cycles\n\nExperience managing cross-functional projects\n\nTeam-oriented mindset with willingness to share knowledge\n\nStrong stakeholder management skills across internal and external teams\n\nAbility to operate in ambiguous and fast-paced environments\n\nPreferred requirements\n\nExperience in sales/customer-facing roles at high-growth tech companies\n\nFamiliarity with API-first solutions\n\nProficiency in French and English', '[\"Sales\",\"AccountManagement\",\"TechnicalUnderstanding\",\"Strategy\",\"Collaboration\",\"RelationshipBuilding\"]', 'Dublin', 0, 'Full-time', 'greenhouse', 'https://stripe.com/jobs/search?gh_jid=7353623', '7353623', '[-0.010449357,0.028016552,0.029995097,-0.06636519,-0.029937735,-0.009195551,0.013306528,0.0053008627,0.024963135,0.000017653201,-0.0098003065,0.0012652637,-0.007480788,-0.018582711,0.11671742,-0.0038422968,0.0138501255,0.030206054,-0.009169584,-0.002525167,0.03489649,0.015228896,0.00493475,-0.0081278,-0.010466378,0.0040679714,0.02264129,0.015092863,0.001707763,-0.012477509,0.0025255699,-0.013898297,0.006116775,0.020008119,0.002391643,0.007902941,-0.0010158058,-0.002266156,0.00031067696,0.029351398,0.0055196392,0.010896417,-0.013312461,-0.016770074,-0.01763333,-0.028378366,0.0023812875,-0.014518594,-0.011341041,0.007646918,-0.009691237,0.004810496,0.0054107658,-0.16374326,-0.018923633,-0.013634851,0.008287183,0.0005353829,0.01570642,-0.040802315,-0.0002455666,0.04313466,0.015251929,-0.03473241,-0.008012132,0.009660659,0.0002783065,0.014242601,-0.0072552506,-0.01377932,0.0155630065,0.018218085,-0.020510854,0.007738639,-0.01406383,0.0036335182,0.031710677,-0.0018564644,0.02591151,-0.008823466,0.016890733,-0.009700959,-0.023519138,-0.014113098,0.0070062554,-0.016383745,0.0026183052,-0.025774797,0.012100215,0.032001194,-0.007956012,0.028696