(136, 'Creative Producer, Events', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>About Stripe</strong></h3>\n<p>Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<h3><strong>About the team</strong></h3>\n<p>Brand Studio lays the foundations that help Stripe accelerate. We do this by creating, evolving, and maintaining Stripe’s high-quality, versatile, and forward-looking brand design systems, event experiences, and advertising campaigns. We sweat the details. We make it seem effortless.</p>\n<h2><strong>What you’ll do</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>This role is dedicated to developing high quality, scalable creative across internal and external events. It sits within the Design team. Experience producing creative/design at scale is a mandatory. This role </strong><strong>does not</strong><strong> sit within Marketing or Corp Events.</strong></p>\n<p>You will be responsible for leading end to end creative production across key Experiential programs. You will partner closely with our Experiential CD to understand the vision, and then work side by side with our designers to execute it successfully. While this role is for a producer, our teams play hybrid roles throughout the course of a project - sometimes it’s more program or project management, sometimes it’s more creative production.</p>\n<h3><strong>Responsibilities</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Creative production:</li>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget oversight and management</li>\n<li>Project scoping, timelines and resourcing</li>\n<li>Source and contract best-in-class external agencies</li>\n<li>Agency oversight and management</li>\n<li>Develop strong relationships and trust with partner teams</li>\n<li>Drive visibility and strong communication across Brand Studio and partner teams</li>\n<li>Identify new ways to scale and build actionable paths forward</li>\n</ul>\n<li>Manage a high volume of simultaneous projects, ranging from small to large scale</li>\n<li>Partner closely with the Experiential CD and Experiential EP to further scale and evolve event design at Stripe; 
