(151, 'Data Migrations Specialist', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>About Stripe</strong></h3>\n<p>Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<h3><strong>About the team</strong></h3>\n<p>The Data Migrations team helps migrate sensitive data to and from the Stripe platform for Stripe’s users. This team works directly with global payment service providers, Stripe users, and internal stakeholders to ensure secure, on-time, and seamless transfers of payment information.</p>\n<h2><strong>What you’ll do</strong></h2>\n<p>As a Data Migrations Specialist, you will play a key role in the onboarding journey of all users migrating to Stripe, including our largest and most complex enterprise users. Execute migrations for a variety of Stripe users while providing insights and recommendations pertaining to a user’s migration use-case, partner with external third-parties and internal stakeholders such as engineering, go to market, professional services and product. This is achieved by demonstrating strong technical acumen and ownership, while balancing multiple migration engagements and proactively looking for opportunities to improve the experience. </p>\n<h3><strong>Responsibilities</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Act as the primary voice of the Data Migrations team; 
