(199, 'Financial Data Analyst-User Billing', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>About Stripe</strong></h3>\n<p>Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone\'s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<h3><strong>About the team</strong></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Stripe’s infrastructure powers businesses all over the world. We process payments, run marketplaces, detect fraud, help entrepreneurs start an internet business from anywhere in the world, build world-class developer-friendly APIs, and more. User Billing provides a central entry point for Stripe products to monetize in global markets. It is ultimately responsible for the systems, programs, and operations that generate Stripe’s revenue and the economic models we have with our customers. This is accomplished through a sophisticated pricing onboarding tooling and workflow management, unified billing engine, and custom solutions for our largest enterprise users. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Our work is core to Stripe’s business. Millions of customers look at us for a reliable and frictionless billing experience with Stripe.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Technical Operations roles are a dynamic and key component of Stripe’s success. Focused on serving Stripe customers, we sit at the intersection of product, sales, engineering, finance, and operations, acting as the connective tissues that ensure internal and external users receive user billing results accurately and timely. </p>\n<h2><strong>What you’ll do</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Responsibilities </strong></h3>\n<p>Your responsibilities include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Perform data analysis, identify trends, conduct research, build visualizations, all to deliver objective, critical insights that fulfill team stakeholders’ (GTM, Accounting, Finance, Tax) business needs </li>\n<li>Perform ticket triaging to identify potential misbilling billing by analyzing transactional data and figuring out the amount to be refunded or clawed back</li>\n<li>Provide data analysis support to Accounting and Finance &amp; 
