INSERT IGNORE INTO `Job` (`id`, `title`, `company`, `description`, `tags`, `location`, `remote`, `jobType`, `sourceApi`, `sourceUrl`, `externalId`, `embedding`, `embeddedAt`, `postedAt`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `category`) VALUES
(245, 'Head of Integrated Campaigns, Startups & AI', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are </strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>About Stripe</strong></h3>\n<p>Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<h3><strong>About the team</strong></h3>\n<p>Stripe’s Integrated Campaigns team drives global strategies to create awareness in the market, engage prospects and customers, and generate opportunities for our broad suite of solutions and products. We work in close partnership with Product Marketing, Regional and Field Marketing, Partner Marketing, Sales and Customer Success, Marketing Operations, Comms, channel teams, and more to build full funnel strategies and deliver campaigns to market.</p>\n<p>We are looking for someone with proven experience leading campaign teams to craft comprehensive integrated marketing strategies for startups and AI companies. This is a key leadership role on Stripe’s Integrated Campaigns team, and will contribute directly to Stripe’s growth. This is an opportunity for someone who is deeply embedded in startup and AI company ecosystems. The ideal candidate doesn’t shy away from building through ambiguity, deeply understands how to measure and translate campaign impact, and stewards healthy and productive cross-functional teams. They are adept at thinking both strategically and tactically to get things done, and are comfortable leading and influencing through complex, global, cross-functional working groups.</p>\n<h2><strong>What you’ll do</strong></h2>\n<p>As the Head of Integrated Campaigns (Startups and AI), you will own our holistic demand plan focused on Startups and AI companies. You’ll lead a team to craft and deliver comprehensive campaigns. You will be responsible for the strategic leadership, operational execution, and management of the team.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lead cross-functional marketing and cross-functional teams towards a singular vision, uniting global stakeholders, strategies, channels, and tactics into a well-orchestrated demand machine.</li>\n<li>Craft holistic integrated campaign strategies, leading with user insights, market dynamics, and performance indicators.</li>\n<li>Own and represent key business and marketing KPIs, performance trends, and insights. Advocate for customer and market trends, and use them to advocate for campaign innovation and evolution.</li>\n<li>Set, measure, achieve, and exceed campaign targets, including reach, acquisition, pipeline, conversion, etc. </li>\n<li>Partner with PMM and Content Marketing to deliver compelling and differentiated messaging, content, and offers to support inbound and outbound efforts.</li>\n<li>Partner with Regional Demand Generation and Field Marketing to deliver campaigns and tactics locally.</li>\n<li>Translate results and make recommendations to cross-functional partners to drive continuous improvement per message and channel.</li>\n<li>Maintain a high quality bar; 
