(352, 'Product Manager, Financial Connections — Merchant Experience', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>About Stripe</strong></h3>\n<p>Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone\'s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<h3><strong>About the team</strong></h3>\n<p>Financial Connections is building the data connectivity layer for open finance and money movement. We are building tools for individuals and businesses to seamlessly share their financial data with Stripe and the businesses we power to unlock new product experiences, receive payouts, and make payments. We empower ambitious global businesses to build innovative products fast and run their entire financial lifecycle on Stripe, and we want you to be part of our story.</p>\n<p>Financial Connections is part of Link. Stripe created Link to reimagine how merchants and consumers do business. With Link, you can save your payment information to be used at hundreds of thousands businesses and you can connect &amp; 
