(512, 'Strategy & Operations, Payouts', 'Stripe', '<h2><strong>Who we are</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>About Stripe</strong> Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<p><strong>About the Product:</strong> Payouts is the engine that powers Stripe’s money movement layer. While Stripe is famous for accepting payments (\"money in\"), the Payouts team ensures that businesses can programmatically access and move that money (\"money out\") to anyone, anywhere, in any currency.</p>\n<p><strong>The Payouts Product Suite</strong></p>\n<p>As a member of the Payouts S&amp;
