(513, 'Stripe Communications (Open Application)', 'Stripe', 'Who we are\n\nAbout Stripe\nStripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone\'s reach while doing the most important work of your career.\n\nAbout the team\nThe Communications team builds and protects Stripe’s brand and influence across the world. We do it with a small team dedicated to creativity and rigor. We’re looking for unconstrained but strategic thinking, not just routine execution. You may design a microsite, launch a podcast, deeply understand products and users, and execute ideas quickly. You’ll collaborate openly, provide strategic counsel to executives, help shape perspectives on emerging areas like AI-driven commerce and crypto, and contribute to major communications like keynotes.\n\nWhat you’ll do\n\nYou’ll help generate excitement about Stripe’s products and their impact. This could involve creating demos, writing speeches, preparing podcasts, and tailoring communication for different audiences such as startup founders, enterprise leaders, developers, or product executives.\n\nKey skills include excellent writing, strong attention to detail, first-principles thinking, creativity, resourcefulness, and curiosity about both Stripe’s technical products and the evolving global economy.\n\nStripe hires flexibly, focusing on exceptional talent rather than rigid roles. Responsibilities are shaped around your strengths, and you’ll work on real projects early on. Roles evolve over time based on company needs and personal growth.\n\nResponsibilities\n\nLead global product communications for key Stripe product areas\n\nDevelop and refine long-term messaging and vision\n\nDesign and execute strategic campaigns\n\nCreate high-quality written content (blogs, speeches, media content, etc.)\n\nCollaborate with regional teams to expand global awareness\n\nBuild relationships with media, influencers, and industry leaders\n\nWork closely with partnerships and product marketing teams\n\nAdvise executives on communication strategy\n\nWho you are\n\nMinimum requirements\n\nExceptional writing skills, especially for simplifying complex technical topics\n\nExperience collaborating with product teams, marketing, and senior leadership\n\nPreferred qualifications\n\nExperience storytelling for a company (founder, journalist, or comms role)\n\nBackground in tech, B2B, finance, or banking\n\nPassion for Stripe’s mission and tools for businesses\n\nDeep understanding of modern media (podcasts, influencers, online platforms) and trends\n\n🔑 5 Required Skills for This Job\n\nExceptional Writing Skills – Ability to clearly explain complex technical ideas in an engaging way\n\nStrategic Thinking – Ability to shape messaging, campaigns, and long-term vision\n\nCreativity & Storytelling – Creating compelling narratives across different formats (blogs, podcasts, speeches)\n\nCollaboration & Communication – Working with product, marketing, and leadership teams effectively\n\nCuriosity & Technical Understanding – Interest in fintech, products, and evolving economic/tech trends', '[\"Writing\",\"Strategy\",\"Creativity\",\"Collaboration\",\"Curiosity\"]\n', 'SF, NYC, LON', 0, 'Full-time', 'greenhouse', 'https://stripe.com/jobs/search?gh_jid=7624667', '7624667', '[0.014406414,0.001163808,0.02241937,-0.07249309,-0.010023772,0.00705125,-0.009765202,0.0009336197,0.029913018,0.013191843,-0.011733227,-0.004144618,-0.020553987,-0.007920459,0.10820912,0.016179819,0.01100694,0.004270027,0.02459387,0.033896122,0.010595288,0.017307926,0.0030355772,-0.014635564,-0.032299064,-0.0135137765,0.02294306,0.0004547322,0.023359908