(544, 'Transfer Pricing Operations Specialist', 'Stripe', '<p><strong>Who we are</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About Stripe</strong></p>\n<p>Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.</p>\n<p><strong>About the team:</strong></p>\n<p>As we expand our product offering and international footprint, we are seeking a Transfer Pricing Operations Specialist with technical transfer pricing knowledge and operational transfer pricing experience. This role will focus on streamlining and enhancing transfer pricing processes, and implementing scalable transfer pricing tools, automation, and workflow solutions. </p>\n<p><strong>What you’ll do:</strong></p>\n<p>The Transfer Pricing Specialist will be a hands-on team member, who works collaboratively across the organization to implement and execute compliant and practical transfer pricing policies and processes. This individual will be an excellent communicator, with the ability to explain transfer pricing concepts and requirements to non-tax people. The ideal candidate will have experience in a high-growth technology or financial services company, partnering with various functional teams and other members of the tax department.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Execute and implement transfer pricing policies. </li>\n<li>Dive deep into financial information to: (1) design and implement transfer pricing calculations; 
