(742, 'Partner Lead, APAC', 'Vercel', '<div class=\"content-intro\"><h2>About Vercel:</h2>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Vercel gives developers the tools and cloud infrastructure to build, scale, and secure a faster, more personalized web. As the team behind v0, Next.js, and AI SDK, Vercel helps customers like Ramp, Supreme, PayPal, and Under Armour build for the AI-native web.<br></span></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Our mission is to enable the world to ship the best products. That starts with creating a place where everyone can do their best work. Whether you\'re building on our platform, supporting our customers, or shaping our story: You can just ship things.</span></p></div><p>The Partner team at Vercel is charged with accelerating our growth with partners. As a <strong>Partner Lead, APAC</strong>, you will play a pivotal role in helping to establish, and grow our partner ecosystem with Technology and Solution partners.</p>\n<p>This is a senior individual contributor role for a builder. You will define the strategy, activate priority partners, and generate meaningful partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline. You’ll work cross-functionally across Sales, Marketing, Product, and Leadership to establish Vercel as a strategic platform within the APAC ecosystem.</p>\n<p>If you are energized by creating net-new revenue streams, shaping GTM strategy with partners, and turning early-stage relationships into scaled growth engines, this role is for you.</p>\n<h3><strong>What you will do:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Build and Scale the APAC Partner Ecosystem</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Define and execute Vercel’s APAC partner strategy across Technology and Solution partners.</li>\n<li>Identify, recruit, and activate high-impact regional and global partners.</li>\n<li>Establish scalable engagement models that drive measurable pipeline and revenue.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Drive Partner-Sourced &amp; 
INSERT IGNORE INTO `Job` (`id`, `title`, `company`, `description`, `tags`, `location`, `remote`, `jobType`, `sourceApi`, `sourceUrl`, `externalId`, `embedding`, `embeddedAt`, `postedAt`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `category`) VALUES
(743, 'Product Lead, v0', 'Vercel', '<div class=\"content-intro\"><h2>About Vercel:</h2>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Vercel gives developers the tools and cloud infrastructure to build, scale, and secure a faster, more personalized web. As the team behind v0, Next.js, and AI SDK, Vercel helps customers like Ramp, Supreme, PayPal, and Under Armour build for the AI-native web.<br></span></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Our mission is to enable the world to ship the best products. That starts with creating a place where everyone can do their best work. Whether you\'re building on our platform, supporting our customers, or shaping our story: You can just ship things.</span></p></div><h2><strong>About the Role</strong></h2>\n<p>We\'re looking for a Product Lead to lead Product Management for v0. v0 is Vercel’s AI-powered generative UI product and you’ll own the product vision, roadmap, and go-to-market strategy while building and managing a high-performing PM team.</p>\n<p>This is a leadership role that requires both strategic thinking and hands-on product work. You\'ll define where v0 goes next, how it integrates with the broader Vercel platform, and how we monetize it effectively.</p>\n<h2><strong>What You\'ll Do</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Drive the v0 roadmap:</strong> Define product strategy, prioritize initiatives, and ship features that drive adoption and revenue</li>\n<li><strong>Engage with customers:</strong> Conduct user research, gather feedback, and translate insights into product decisions</li>\n<li><strong>Own cross-functional execution:</strong> Partner with Engineering, Design, Marketing, Sales, and Support to deliver outcomes</li>\n<li><strong>Represent v0 externally:</strong> Work with Marketing on positioning, launches, and customer communications</li>\n<li><strong>Determine pricing and packaging:</strong> Work with Vercel’s pricing team to develop pricing models and ensure v0 integrates seamlessly with Vercel\'s product suite</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>About You</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Track record of excellence – winning competitions, founding companies, rapid promotions</li>\n<li>5+ years of product management experience</li>\n<li>Track record of shipping developer tools, AI products, or platforms at scale</li>\n<li>Experience owning pricing, packaging, and product-led growth strategies</li>\n<li>Background in Computer Science or Engineering roles</li>\n<li>Clear communicator who can align stakeholders and make decisions with incomplete information</li>\n<li>Familiarity with the frontend ecosystem and how developers build for the web</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>Nice to Have</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Experience with AI/ML products or generative AI applications</li>\n<li>Background in design tools or creative software</li>\n<li>Previous experience at a high-growth infrastructure or developer tools company</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>Why Vercel</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Competitive compensation including salary, equity, and benefits</li>\n<li>Work on a product at the intersection of AI and frontend development</li>\n<li>Join a team that values shipping, iteration, and customer obsession</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-copy-16 text-gray-900 [&amp;
