(759, 'Senior Partner Manager', 'Vercel', '<div class=\"content-intro\"><h2>About Vercel:</h2>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Vercel gives developers the tools and cloud infrastructure to build, scale, and secure a faster, more personalized web. As the team behind v0, Next.js, and AI SDK, Vercel helps customers like Ramp, Supreme, PayPal, and Under Armour build for the AI-native web.<br></span></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Our mission is to enable the world to ship the best products. That starts with creating a place where everyone can do their best work. Whether you\'re building on our platform, supporting our customers, or shaping our story: You can just ship things.</span></p></div><h2>About Vercel:</h2>\n<p>Vercel gives developers the tools and cloud infrastructure to build, scale, and secure a faster, more personalized web. As the team behind v0, Next.js, and AI SDK, Vercel helps customers like Ramp, Supreme, PayPal, and Under Armour build for the AI-native web.</p>\n<p>Our mission is to enable the world ship the best products. That starts with creating a place where everyone can do their best work. Whether you\'re building on our platform, supporting our customers, or shaping our story: You can just ship things.</p>\n<h2>About the Role:</h2>\n<div id=\"message-list_1773330205.992419\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>The Partner Team at Vercel is charged with creating mutual success for Vercel, our partners and our customers. We are seeking a Senior Partner Manager to join our growing Partnerships team. In this role, you will own and manage a portfolio of solution partners and technology alliances focused on AI and agentic ecosystems, supporting them as they build, launch, and scale with Vercel. You will play a key role in driving joint customer success. This role will report directly to the Director of Partnerships, Commerce &amp; 
