ories</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Partner with startups to develop case studies, video content, and testimonials that highlight technical wins, speed-to-market advantages, and business outcomes</li>\n<li>Craft narratives that speak to both technical decision-makers and business stakeholders at early-stage companies</li>\n<li>Collaborate with content, design, and product marketing teams to produce high-quality, developer-authentic assets</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gather &amp; 
