(872, 'Engineering Manager, Auth & Identity', 'Anthropic', '<div class=\"content-intro\"><h2><strong>About Anthropic</strong></h2>\n<p>Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.</p></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5\">About the role:</h2>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">We are looking for an Engineering Manager to join our Platform org to lead and grow teams of software engineers working on foundational platform capabilities. You\'ll be responsible for defining and executing the creation of shared product capabilities at the core of Anthropic\'s product surfaces, while maintaining clear direction and stability for your team.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">You\'ll partner closely with product managers, engineering leadership, talented engineers and research teams to transform emerging AI capabilities into platform capabilities. Success in this role requires a strong ability to understand stakeholder needs, identify opportunities to share capabilities across products, understand our product and roadmap deeply, and the ability to facilitate rapid iterations to improve our product suite.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Auth &amp; 
