(960, 'Industry Advisor, Cybersecurity', 'Anthropic', '<div class=\"content-intro\"><h2><strong>About Anthropic</strong></h2>\n<p>Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.</p></div><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2>\n<p>The CISO in Residence is a senior executive advisor and thought leader who brings deep, real-world CISO experience to help guide enterprise customers, partners, and regulators through the secure adoption of AI systems.</p>\n<p>This is not an operational, internal CISO position. Instead, it is a highly strategic, externally-facing executive role designed to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Serve as a trusted peer advisor to enterprise CISOs, security leaders, and executive teams navigating AI adoption</li>\n<li>Provide executive-level guidance on AI security strategy, risk management, and governance</li>\n<li>Represent Anthropic in industry forums, regulatory discussions, and executive engagements</li>\n<li>Act as a bridge between customer and industry security priorities and Anthropic’s product, policy, and go-to-market teams</li>\n<li>Help shape the emerging discipline of AI security by drawing on deep enterprise security expertise</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The ideal candidate is a former CISO or senior security executive with a proven ability to translate technical security strategy into measurable business outcomes, and who is passionate about the safe and responsible deployment of AI.</p>\n<h2><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Executive Advisory &amp; 
