(7, 3, 'Untitled document.pdf', 'ADEEN HUSSAIN Software Developer | Full-Stack Specialist Karachi, Pakistan | 92-3351211229 hussainshai972@gmail.com | adeen-hussain.github.io PROFILE Analytical and detail-oriented Software Developer with a strong foundation in Full-Stack development (MERN) and Backend Architecture . Proven track record in developing RESTful APIs, optimizing database schemas, and improving UI/UX responsiveness. Passionate about testing code boundaries and evaluating AI system logic through comprehensive functional testing and edge-case analysis. TECHNICAL SKILLS ● Languages & Frameworks: JavaScript (Node.js, Express), React.js, PHP, Python (Learning/Basics). ● Backend & APIs: RESTful API Development, Scalable API Design, Node.js. ● Database Management: MySQL, Database Normalization, Schema Design. ● Tools & Testing: Functional Testing, UI/UX Debugging, Git/GitHub (CI/CD workflows), WordPress Customization. ● Soft Skills: Complex Problem Solving, Technical Documentation, Agile Collaboration. RELEVANT WORK EXPERIENCE Glide Ups | Senior Backend Developer | Nov 2025 – Present ● Architecting and maintaining robust Node.js backend systems and RESTful APIs . ● Leading Database Normalization efforts in MySQL to ensure data integrity and system efficiency. ● Conducting deep-dive code reviews and debugging sessions to identify logic failures in production-level code. VativeApps | Middle Web Developer | Jun 2025 – Nov 2025 ● Developed interactive front-end solutions using React-based methodologies. ● Collaborated in Agile environments , focusing on iterative feedback and meeting high-quality acceptance criteria. ● Managed responsive design implementation across diverse device breakpoints. Vals Group | Intern WordPress Developer | Jun 2024 – Aug 2024 ● Identified and resolved complex UI/UX issues , improving site performance and user navigation. ● Gained experience with Content Management Systems (CMS) and integrated third-party web technologies. EDUCATION ● Sof